                   'into the MolePro KP, then sent via TRAPI message to the ARAGORN '
                   'ARA, and finally sent to the NCATS ARS. The retrieval path for '
                   'this Edge is as follows: ARS--retrieved_from-->  ARAGORN  '
                   '--retrieved_from-->   MolePro  --retrieved_from--> ChEMBL '
                   '--retrieved_from-->  ClinicalTrials.gov The "primary knowledge '
